0.059 0.09 0.165 rg
39.6850393700787407 609.4490551181102092 Td
(In India, thousands of central and state welfare subsidies and scholarships go unclaimed each year due to three systemic bottlenecks:) Tj
T* (  1. Information Fragmentation: Schemes are scattered across disconnected portals \(MyScheme, MahaDBT, PM-KISAN, Aaple Sarkar\).) Tj
T* (  2. Certificate Redundancy: Citizens make repetitive trips to Tehsil offices for common prerequisites \(Income, Domicile, Caste, 7/12\).) Tj
T* (  3. AI Hallucination Risk: Generic chatbots often invent fake deadlines or eligibility requirements for government programs.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (JanSahay AI solves this with a deterministic rules engine, cross-scheme document deduplication, a grounded RAG AI assistant with) Tj
T* (100% benchmark retrieval accuracy, and a verified catalog of 50 welfare schemes and 14 statutory RTS document guides.) Tj
