(JanSahay AI is architected as a resilient, decoupled web system designed to handle intermittent rural connectivity.) Tj
T* (• Client Tier: Single Page Application \(SPA\) with Progressive Web App \(PWA\) service worker caching static assets and catalog) Tj
T* (responses.) Tj
T* (• Security Tier: Multi-tier rate limiting \(strict on auth and AI endpoints\), helmet security headers, and strict Zod validation.) Tj
T* (• API Services Tier: Modular micro-services decoupling eligibility evaluation, document deduplication, live scraping, and RAG search.) Tj
T* (• Database Tier: Dual-mode relational PostgreSQL 16 schema with automatic fallback to high-performance local persistence.) Tj
