(Unlike probabilistic AI models that can generate unpredictable matching scores, JanSahay AI uses a 100% deterministic) Tj
T* (rules engine \(eligibilityEngine.js\) guaranteeing reproducible, verifiable citizen recommendations.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (• Classification Categories:) Tj
T* (    1. Strong Match \(>= 80% criteria satisfied, all mandatory conditions met\)) Tj
T* (    2. Potential Match \(50% to 79% satisfied, minor demographic criteria incomplete\)) Tj
T* (    3. More Information Required \(Crucial profile attributes such as land holding or annual income unset\)) Tj
T* (    4. Not a Match \(Exceeds maximum income cap or fails state residency requirement\)) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (• Supported Condition Operators:) Tj
T* (    EQUALS, NOT_EQUALS \(case-insensitive strings\), IN \(comma-separated tokens\), CONTAINS \(substring matching\),) Tj
T* (    GREATER_THAN, GREATER_THAN_OR_EQUAL, LESS_THAN, LESS_THAN_OR_EQUAL \(numeric thresholds\).) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (• Condition Diagnostics: Explains precisely WHY a scheme was matched or rejected to prevent citizen confusion.) Tj
